# Swift Horde skeletal horse from Zachariah Post (Brill).
# Sources: Forever client 1.60.1.70338 tables via wago.tools (ItemSparse: level,
# price, races, riding spell; SkillLineAbility: Riding); npcs.json and
# items.json for the trainer, the vendor and its stock.
# Forever riding: one Riding skill (Apprentice 75 from level 40, Journeyman 150
# at 60). Training costs 100g and 1,000g (Forever's world data: the trainers of
# Velma Warnam and Genn Fairweather, build 70124) and comes with a mount
# (Blizzard). ItemSparse lists the mounts at 20g (level 40) and 200g (level 60)
# for every race of the faction, but each one also needs Undead Horsemanship (10906;
# MountCapability), which SkillLineAbility gives only Undead with Riding: the
# faction's other races and the Skyborne must learn it.
# ASSUMED: Velma Warnam teaches it to them at Exalted with Undercity (Classic
# rule; a beta player guide says other races' mounts need Exalted). In-game
# check: a Orc at Velma Warnam, with and without Exalted.
# ASSUMED: Honored with your race's home city takes 10% off training and mounts
# (beta player guides; Classic had the same). In-game check: the price at Honored.

step Journeyman Riding
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  tip Velma Warnam and Zachariah Post's stable are in Brill, Tirisfal Glades. At 60 Velma Warnam teaches Journeyman Riding to Undead for 1,000g (10% less at Honored with Undercity); Blizzard says it comes with a mount. Other races train it at their own race's riding trainer. Each skeletal warhorse costs 200g here.
  level 60
  train 4773 only Undead              -- Velma Warnam, riding trainer
  skill Riding 150

step Undead Horsemanship for other races
  only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Skyborne
  when !knows 10906
  tip Any Horde race can buy these skeletal horses, but riding one also takes Undead Horsemanship, which only Undead get with Riding. Velma Warnam teaches it to other races once they are Exalted with Undercity (the Undercity Reputation guide shows the way). Until then, don't buy a skeletal horse for this character.
  rep "Undercity" Exalted
  train 4773                          -- Velma Warnam, Undead Horsemanship

step Pick a colour
  tip Zachariah Post sells the other colours (200g each in the Forever client). Buy any you want, or none if the mount you were given is the one you like.
  vendor 4731                         -- Zachariah Post
  buy 13334 npc 4731 optional         -- Green Skeletal Warhorse, 200g
  buy 18791 npc 4731 optional         -- Purple Skeletal Warhorse, 200g
  note The new Forever Green, Dark and Purple Skeletal Horses and the Ochre Skeletal Warhorse (level 60) have no known source yet.
